Current Dev Position: YP 2.3 M4

Next Deadline: YP 2.3 M4 Cutoff is April 10, 2017


*** FEATURE FREEZE for 2.3 is now in effect. ***


SWAT team rotation: Stephano -> Maxin on Mar. 31, 2017.

SWAT team rotation: Maxin -> Cal on April 7, 2017.

https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Yocto_Build_Failure_Swat_Team


Key Status/Updates:

=B7        YP 2.3 M3 rc2 is in QA.  The live status is at: https://wiki.yoc=
toproject.org/wiki/2.3_QA_Status#Summary_Report

=B7        Unfortunately QA have run into issues running some tests where P=
R Server log output is corrupting the test results (bug 11284) caused by so=
me of the tinfoil logging changes. We=92re hoping to be able to work around=
 this for the current QA run since its currently blocking many tests.

=B7        We also continue to see a large number of issues around sysroot =
tools like runqemu after the recipe specific sysroot changes which continue=
 to be worked upon, particularly with interactions like other code, e.g. rm=
_work.

=B7        On a positive note, the autobuilder performance does seem to be =
much improved now we=92ve identified some performance issues in a number of=
 areas including the tests themselves.

=B7        Patches continue to flow at a high rate into the branch but we a=
re going to have to start being more selective about which patches improve =
stability/quality as some fixes are introducing regressions and defects in =
submitted patches continue to take up a lot of review and testing time.

=B7        Since we=92re into the stabilization phase of 2.3, planning for =
2.4 has begun and we=92re entering 2.4 ideas and enhancements in to bugzill=
a. If you have suggestions for 2.4, please ensure they are in bugzilla.


Proposed upcoming dot releases:

YP 2.1.3 Cut off May 15, 2017

YP 2.1.3 Release by May 26, 2017

YP 2.2.2 Cut off May 29, 2017

YP 2.2.2 Release by June 9, 2017


Key YP 2.3 Dates:

YP 2.3 M3 Release is Mar. 10, 2017 (Will be a few weeks late.)

YP 2.3 M4 Cutoff is April 10, 2017

YP 2.3 M4 Release is May 5, 2017


